@startuml Sequence_Lihat_Laporan_Transaksi
title Sequence Diagram - Lihat Laporan Transaksi (Admin)

actor "Admin" as Admin
boundary "Halaman Laporan Transaksi" as GUI
control "LihatLaporanTransaksiController" as Controller
entity "Tabel Transaksi" as DB

Admin -> GUI: 1. Mengakses menu Laporan Transaksi
activate GUI
GUI -> Controller: 2. Request data laporan
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 3. Cek user adalah Admin

Controller -> DB: 4. Ambil data laporan transaksi dari database
activate DB
DB --> Controller: 5. Data transaksi ditemukan
deactivate DB

Controller --> GUI: 6. Kirim data laporan
deactivate Controller
GUI --> Admin: 7. Tampilkan halaman laporan dengan:\n- Form filter (tanggal, status)\n- Tombol Export\n- Tabel transaksi (detail lengkap)
deactivate GUI

Admin -> GUI: 8. Memilih filter tanggal dan/atau status
activate GUI
Admin -> GUI: 9. Klik tombol Tampilkan
GUI -> Controller: 10. Request filter laporan
activate Controller

Controller -> DB: 11. Filter transaksi berdasarkan\nrentang tanggal dan status yang dipilih
activate DB
DB --> Controller: 12. Data filtered ditemukan
deactivate DB

Controller --> GUI: 13. Kirim hasil filter
deactivate Controller
GUI --> Admin: 14. Tampilkan hasil filter
deactivate GUI

Admin -> GUI: 15. Klik "Lihat Detail" pada transaksi
activate GUI
GUI --> Admin: 16. Redirect ke /admin/laporan/{id}
deactivate GUI

alt User bukan Admin
    Admin -> GUI: 1a. Akses menu dengan akun non-admin
    GUI -> Controller: 2a. Request laporan
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Controller: 3a. Cek user dan bukan admin
    Controller --> GUI: 4a. Error 403
    deactivate Controller
    GUI --> Admin: 5a. Tampilkan error 403
else Export laporan
    Admin -> GUI: 1b. Klik tombol Export ke Excel/CSV
    GUI -> Controller: 2b. Request export laporan
    activate Controller
    Controller -> DB: 3b. Ambil data transaksi sesuai filter
    activate DB
    DB --> Controller: 4b. Data transaksi ditemukan
    deactivate DB
    Controller -> Controller: 5b. Generate file Excel/CSV dengan:\n- Header kolom\n- Data transaksi (row by row)\n- Format tanggal & currency\n- Total summary
    Controller --> GUI: 6b. Kirim file untuk download
    deactivate Controller
    GUI --> Admin: 7b. Browser download file\n"laporan-{date}.xlsx"
end

@enduml
